{"name":"Transfer receipt shows the stored amount, blank if the transfer does not exist","category":"policy","priority":"P2","statement":"The transfer receipt page looks up the transfer by the number given in the request and shows that number together with the stored amount, formatted with two decimals. If no transfer has that number, the amount is left blank and no error is shown.","condition":"A TRANSFERENCIAS row exists with TRF_NUMERO = requested number (amount shown); no such row exists (amount blank).","action":"Set the number label to the requested number. Set the amount label to TRF_MONTO formatted as \"0.00\" when the row is found, or to an empty string when it is not."}

Cited lines:
Comprobante.aspx.cs:16-21:
   16              SqlCommand leer = new SqlCommand(
